  "details": "When using a smaller avatar the avatar crumples up in FBT using legacy IK. Joining a different world or rejoining the instance consistently fixes the issue until you recalibrate or use any scaling system. Sometimes when switching avatars the fullbody tracking works again as well. It looks like the head and torse are moved down too much and the knees and arms get bent with it. First picture shows cat avatar with the issue second picture show cat avatar after reloading the world. Both while using FBT in legacy ik with arms against legs. Third with mini tiny avatar where the issue gets even worse and fourth with the same avatar with fully working legacy FBT after rejoining.",
